---
layout: article
title: Limits and retention
description: Appwrite Analytics plan limits for events, properties, and data retention, and the size limits for events, properties, and metric queries.
---

This page lists how much Appwrite Analytics accepts and keeps on each plan, and the size limits that apply to every event and request.

# Plan limits {% #plans %}

| | Free | Pro | Enterprise |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| Events | 50K per month | 100K per month | Custom |
| Additional events | Not available | $3 per 100K events | Custom |
| Properties | 1 per project | 5 per project | Unlimited |
| Data retention | 30 days | 90 days | Custom |

The events limit covers every property in the organization. Every event Appwrite accepts counts toward it, including the automatic events the tracking helpers send, such as `scroll_depth` and `engagement_time`. Events from [bots](/docs/products/analytics/bots) don't count.

For the rest of each plan, see [Pricing](/pricing).

# Retention {% #retention %}

Appwrite keeps events for your plan's retention period. The dashboard and `listMetrics` only return data inside that period. A date range that starts earlier, such as **Last 12 months** on the Free plan, starts at the oldest data you can access.

# Event limits {% #event-limits %}

| Field | Limit |
| --- | --- |
| `name` | 1 to 64 characters |
| `url` | Required, with a scheme such as `https://` |
| `domain` | Up to 255 characters |
| `referrer` | Up to 2,048 characters |
| `scrollDepth` | `0` to `100` |
| `sessionHash` | Up to 128 characters |
| `props` | Up to 32 items, so 16 key and value pairs, each up to 255 characters |
| `userId` | Up to 64 characters |
| `ip` | Up to 45 characters |
| `userAgent` | Up to 2,048 characters |

An event over any limit is rejected with a `400` `general_argument_invalid` error.

# Property limits {% #property-limits %}

| Field | Limit |
| --- | --- |
| Property ID | Up to 36 characters: letters, numbers, periods, hyphens, and underscores, not starting with a special character |
| Name | Up to 128 characters |
| Domain | Up to 255 characters |
| Allowed origins | Up to 64 origins, each up to 255 characters |

# Metric query limits {% #query-limits %}

| Parameter | Limit |
| --- | --- |
| `queries` | Up to 10 filters |
| `dimensions` | One dimension per request |
| `limit` | 1 to 500 rows, 100 by default |

On the dashboard, the hourly **1h** interval is available for date ranges of 31 days or less.
